MISSION_OBJECTIVE=Complete the terminal Epoch 3 upgrade under one exact bounded LPCL: deploy the validated Mission Control lifecycle/database repair, restore and integrate the LPCL Control Panel, preserve historical mission truth across schema generations, expose restart/audit/redesign/component/rollback lifecycle controls, reconcile the hybrid Local plus ChatGPT SaaS supervisory architecture, upgrade and synchronize the canonical repository, all connected hosts, local Windows and WSL worktrees, and the ten-repository federation, recover and update PR 337, execute exact-head CI and bounded merge/closure only after green validation, finish open Epoch 3 missions, materialize terminal documentation and RAG handoff, and leave an exact stable control/scaffolding baseline for Epoch 4.
MISSION_DESCRIPTION=This is the authorization carrier for the final Epoch 3 convergence. The mission must treat Mission Control and LION CONTROL LPCL PANEL as the canonical operator surfaces for future evolution. It must migrate Mission Control databases additively and versionedly without inventing historical values; missing fields from pre-schema missions must be rendered as NOT_RECORDED_AT_SOURCE_STAGE and never coerced to zero. It must preserve dirty, ahead, divergent and operator-owned work; never force-push or rewrite history; back up and digest every database before migration; create explicit rollback points before consequential effects; bind every effect to the active exact LPCL; reacquire source/currentness before each effect; synchronize all reachable LION repositories and host worktrees without destroying local work; upgrade GitHub through the existing PR 337 publication line when safe; validate the entire exact candidate; close or supersede prior Epoch 3 missions only with evidence; keep Semantic Inference Compiler candidate-only with authority effect NONE; and declare Epoch 3 complete only after runtime, database, repository, GitHub, host, documentation and control-plane readback converge.

